<h1>Pick Single Point</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Measure &gt; Pick Single Point</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">or from</span> <span class="Button">Pick single point</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button on the</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>toolbar</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">. If</span> <span class="Button">Pick Single Point</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is not selected on the toolbar, hold down the left mouse button on the current selection for a second to show up the drop-down toolbar. Select</span> <span class="Button">Pick Single Point</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button from there.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB">Select a point by clicking on it. The Picked Points information box will appear, and display the</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">, and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">co-ordinates of the selected point.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../measure_menu/Commands_files/image284.gif" width="32px" height="32px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">&#160;&#160;&#160; Mouse pointers in</span> <span class="Mode" style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;"><b>Pick Single Point</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This information will also be copied in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Output</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">pane.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP227698464" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
